	.string "COZMO: They took my METEORITE.\nI only agreed to share its data!\p"
	.string "The cable car leads to MT. CHIMNEY.\nPlease stop their experiment.$"

MeteorFalls_1F_1R_Mountain_TextQuiet::
	.string "COZMO: The summit readings still\nworry me. Please be careful.$"

MeteorFalls_1F_1R_Mountain_TextWait::
	.string "MAGMA: The boss needs this sample.\nStay on the upper landing.$"
